From 81477ca05483368edd1ca8b3938d8f276cc78c36 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Nicole Muzzin <nicole@muzz.in>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 03:59:01 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] layout: list numbering and CSS counters

Every ordered-list marker and counter() rendered 0. List items now get
their HTML ordinal (the list's start and reversed, each li's value), and
decimal, alphabetic, roman, greek and the decimal-digit scripts format
it. counter() and counters() take named counters from counter-reset and
counter-increment on elements and their ::before/::after, found by
walking the document in tree order to the pseudo-element (stylo parses
both properties for Servo now).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
